timeline.body:
@meteorcloudy Could you review the changes to the Bazel client?
@meisterT Could you review the other changes? Feel free to suggest other reviewers, this change really cuts through the whole code base.

Sorry for the large PR, but I needed to make sure encodings are consistent everywhere to get the tests to pass. Without them, it would be very hard to tell whether we regressed any use case that happened to work before this change.

